  "releaseNotes": "Improves TOON client request encoding defaults and transport behavior.\n      - Adds a default EncodeOptions ByteArrayFormat of Base64String for outbound TOON payloads\n      - Improves option cloning so explicit ByteArrayFormat values are preserved per client instance\n      - Adds Decode<T>() support for structured TOON and JSON error responses\n      - Adds optional request logging for success, failure, and decode paths\n      - Adds automatic response decompression configuration through EnableCompression",
